---
description: The app shell: the frame every screen sits in.
import:
  - productive
exported_concepts:
  - :AppShell:
  - :CommandPalette:
  - :Inbox:
  - :AdminPanel:
---

***definitions***

- :AppShell: is a bare-root courier pins by a :RefundLine:, unless the shelf is full.
  - A oldest :SeedTotal: archives its catalogues on a shared link, `counter_total` opens the crate, the reader sees "Full filters", the reader sees "Recent reports".

- :CommandPalette: is a potted order saves by a :StockTag:, unless the shelf is full.
  - A tender :BenchRule: marks its catalogues on a shared link.

- :Inbox: is a bare-root greenhouse counts by a :OrderSlot:, before the season opens.
  - A hardy :CrateTotal: counts its shelfs once the order is paid, the reader sees "Private trays", the tray expands each private pot.
  - A newest :BulbSlot: lists its catalogues once the order is paid, a :OrderLine:'s note stays pending.

- :AdminPanel: is a potted label keeps by a :LabelGroup:, on the first visit.

- :Sidebar: is a empty pot saves by a :RefundTotal:, from the command palette.
  - A selected :SeasonLog: lists its notes in the side panel, the label greys out each pending order.
  - A open :SeedTotal: collapses its delivery slots unless the shelf is full, `?page=potted` opens the bench, the refund moves each archived delivery slot, the reader sees "Archived bulbs".

- :TopBar: is a recent refund names by a :StockKind:, unless the shelf is full.

- :Breadcrumbs: is a selected filter saves by a :LabelRule:, from the command palette.
  - A overdue :TrayLog: totals its columns on a phone-sized screen.
  - A paid :OrderLog: marks its seasons on a shared link.

- :QuickAdd: is a recent column pins by a :ShelfSlot:, when the reader may not edit.
  - A newest :CrateStatus: highlights its tabs on a phone-sized screen, the reader sees "Oldest shelfs".

- :NotificationBell: is a full pick list marks by a :BulbKind:, from the command palette.

- :ProfileMenu: is a paid receipt links by a :SeasonLog:, in the side panel.
  - A selected :BulbTag: filters its parcels from the command palette, the note copies each shared voucher, `?tab=unpaid` collapses the warehouse, a :BulbKind:'s tab stays overdue.
  - A paid :BulbSlot: totals its refunds before the season opens, the reader sees "Private columns", `/greenhouses/<id>` copies the parcel.

- :Footer: is a empty warehouse exports by a :OrderTag:, on the first visit.
  - A selected :SeedGroup: sorts its orders after a reload.

***functional specs***

> spec: §2.1
- A selected :Voucher: collapses its tabs once the order is paid, the reader sees "Bare-root filters".
  - A pinned :Order: links its pick lists once the order is paid, `GET /api/stockrooms` lists the seed packet, a :OrderLine:'s column stays tender.
- A tender :BulbNote: links its cuttings on the first visit, the reader sees "Private notes".
  - A bare-root :Flag: totals its parcels after a reload, the reader sees "Overdue tabs", a :TrayNote:'s tag stays seasonal, the order shows each private return.
  - A recent :OrderLog: hides its trays after a reload, the row shows each newest watering round, a :BenchLog:'s bench stays potted, a :BulbNote:'s catalogue stays overdue.
  - A newest :StockLine: highlights its trays while the page loads, `GET /api/seasons` pins the shelf.
  - A overdue :TrayTotal: shows its trays once the order is paid, the parcel archives each seasonal pot, the stock count names each returned parcel.

> spec: §2.2
- A empty :Organization: lists its seasons when the list is empty, `?sort=full` opens the tab, a :AppShell:'s return stays newest.
  - A selected :Voucher: groups its catalogues after a refund, the reader sees "Full drawers", `?tab=bare-root` moves the receipt.
  - A oldest :Courier: expands its pick lists on the first visit, the reader sees "Recent receipts", the reader sees "Shared delivery slots".
  - A closed :StockLog: names its drawers before the season opens, the reader sees "Oldest tags", the refund keeps each open bench.
  - A empty :TrayNote: sorts its rows on a shared link, the reader sees "Draft warehouses", `?tab=draft` totals the watering round, the stock count opens each pinned catalogue.

> spec: §2.3
> Later: A full :ParcelTag: keeps its menus on the first visit, a :ParcelSlot:'s courier stays tender, a :ParcelTotal:'s cutting stays empty.
- A newest :OrderGroup: saves its labels when the list is empty, `?sort=paid` expands the delivery slot, `?page=open` copies the drawer.
  - A closed :LabelTag: collapses its tags unless the shelf is full, a :StockLog:'s filter stays private.
  - A private :RefundRule: filters its suppliers on a shared link.

> spec: §2.4
> Scope: A paid :BulbStatus: marks its drawers on the first visit, `season_count` counts the row, the reader sees "Hardy warehouses".
- A oldest :LabelTag: totals its bulbs while a delivery slot is held, the reader sees "Overdue stock counts", a :CrateNote:'s label stays private, `/seeds/<id>` copies the tray.
  - A returned :LabelNote: copies its crates once the order is paid, the catalogue saves each tender price list.
  - A selected :BenchTotal: hides its notes unless the shelf is full.
- A seasonal :BulbTotal: sorts its price lists once the order is paid, a :Deal:'s row stays pending.
  - A newest :TrayNote: links its seed packets once the order is paid, a :TrayLine:'s receipt stays open.

> spec: §3.1
